Package: yellow-silence
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Yellow Silence contributors <yellow-silence@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: wireplumber | pulseaudio-utils, xdg-desktop-portal, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-pipewire
Homepage: https://github.com/volodymyroliinyk/yellow-silence
Description: Mute audio while a configured yellow screen bar is visible
 Yellow Silence monitors the desktop while a configured browser is running.
 It controls the default audio sink through PipeWire or PulseAudio.
